	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D1:\n+5V and +3V3 are new rails for the converters and the isolator board side (added 2026-11-07). Both TPS7A4901 (as U30), fed from +12V_IN (the raw J2 input, same GND) rather than the A1212S +12V so U32's 83 mA budget is untouched [H: existing +12V load ~30 mA + 40 mA would be close]. FB: R91/R92 and R93/R94 by the D-01 method; 10 nF NR/SS, 10 uF X5R in and out as on sheet [4]. LCSC numbers for 32.4k / 17.8k 0603 to confirm (TBD in the fields)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 101.6 0)
		(size 62 20)
		(margins 1 1 1 1)
		(stroke
			(width 0.8)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
